@studentToken = replace-with-student-token

### Candidater à une offre publiée
POST http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{studentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "offerId": 3,
  "message": "Je souhaite proposer ma candidature."
}

### Consulter ses candidatures
GET http://localhost:3000/applications
Authorization: {{studentToken}}

### Retirer une candidature
DELETE http://localhost:3000/applications/1
Authorization: {{studentToken}}
